      },
      "rev_n_1_e874cb_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_e874cb_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_e874cb",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous solution was that it didn't consider the case where a lamp of power l illuminates the segment [x; x + l] and not just [x; x + l - 1]. This oversight led to incorrect handling of some test cases, particularly when the last position needed to be illuminated. Let's modify the approach to correctly account for this illumination pattern.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_e874cb_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_e9a43c6b8b",
        "created_at": 1794530667.8078685
      },
      "rev_n_2_12c3c2_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_12c3c2_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_12c3c2",
        "thought_text": "The current approach is incorrect because it doesn't consider the possibility of placing lamps at blocked positions. We need to modify the algorithm to allow lamps to be placed at blocked positions if they can still illuminate the entire segment. This requires a different dynamic programming approach that considers the flexibility of lamp placement.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_12c3c2_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_13056e84a1",
        "created_at": 1794530703.079323
      },
      "rev_n_3_8fe199_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_8fe199_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_8fe199",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous implementation was that it didn't consider the blocked positions when calculating the minimum cost. The current position should be checked against the blocked list before updating the minimum cost. This oversight led to incorrect results in some cases, particularly when blocked positions were present.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_8fe199_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_8291ce9269",
        "created_at": 1794530735.2437415
      },
      "rev_n_4_8c6ced_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_8c6ced_0",
        "node_id": "n_4_8c6ced",
        "thought_text": "Consider using dynamic programming to efficiently calculate the minimum cost for each position.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "3675084714679915308",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794530764.029957
      },
      "rev_n_5_6e4471_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_5_6e4471_0",
        "node_id": "n_5_6e4471",
        "thought_text": "Implement a greedy approach to place lamps at the furthest possible positions first, which may lead to suboptimal solutions in some cases.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "3675084714679915308",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794530764.029974
      },
      "rev_n_6_f60407_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_6_f60407_0",
        "node_id": "n_6_f60407",
        "thought_text": "Explore a binary search approach to find the minimum lamp power that can illuminate the entire street, combined with dynamic programming to check feasibility.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "3675084714679915308",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794530764.0299826
      },
      "rev_n_4_8c6ced_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_8c6ced_1",
        "node_id": "n_4_8c6ced",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous solution was due to not considering the case where a lamp of power l illuminates the segment [x; x + l] and not just [x; x + l - 1]. This oversight led to incorrect handling of some test cases, particularly when the last position needed to be illuminated. To address this, we should modify the approach to correctly account for this illumination pattern by iterating over the range [pos, end_pos) instead of [pos, end_pos - 1) when updating the minimum cost for each position.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "3675084714679915308",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_4_8c6ced_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_3236c7cdbb",
        "created_at": 1794530793.6829507
      },
      "rev_n_5_6e4471_1": {
